#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:1
msgid "Nexus 文档系统架构与交付规划"
msgstr "Nexus documentation-system architecture and delivery plan"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:3
msgid ""
"本方案把现有维护合同、公共 API、使用说明和交付证据组织为一个按读者任务导航、 版本明确、可离线取得的文档系统。正文使用现有 Markdown "
"和公开头文件；站点继续 采用 Sphinx、Doxygen、Breathe，增加 MyST。产品代码和策略仍在外部仓库。"
msgstr ""
"Organize maintained contracts, public APIs, usage guidance and evidence into"
" task-oriented, versioned, independently obtainable offline documentation. "
"Reuse Markdown/public headers with Sphinx, Doxygen and Breathe, adding MyST."
" Product code/policy stays external."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:7
msgid ""
"站点、CLI、依赖锁、正文、翻译和图册已按本方案实现。实际构建、发布和恢复 以 {download}`58 项实施台账 <documentation-"
"system-execution.csv>`及对应执行证据为准； {download}`迁移映射 <documentation-"
"migration.csv>`记录当前内容的去向和保留规则。 这份文档不修改既有平台支持、软件资格或实板状态。 新增和修改文档遵守 "
"[内容与图示标准](documentation-standards.md)及 [页面模板](documentation-"
"templates.md)。[完整优化清单](documentation-improvements.md) "
"从同一台账派生；[参考图册](../assets/diagrams/README.md)区分当前与目标视图。"
msgstr ""
"The site, CLI, locks, prose, translations and diagram set implement this "
"plan. Actual build/publication/recovery follows the {download}`58-item "
"implementation ledger <documentation-system-execution.csv>` and execution "
"evidence; the {download}`migration mapping <documentation-migration.csv>` "
"records destinations/retention. This document changes no platform support, "
"software qualification or physical status. New/changed docs follow "
"[content/diagram standards](documentation-standards.md) and "
"[templates](documentation-templates.md). The [complete "
"checklist](documentation-improvements.md) derives from that ledger; "
"[diagrams](../assets/diagrams/README.md) distinguish current/target views."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:15
msgid "1. 目标和边界"
msgstr "1. Goals and boundaries"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:17
msgid ""
"文档首先帮助应用开发者正确使用平台，其次帮助接入者扩展平台，最后帮助维护者 和验收人员判断变更与证据。读者能够完成一次明确任务，不需要先遍历实施历史。"
msgstr ""
"Help application developers use the platform correctly first, integrators "
"extend it second, and maintainers/reviewers assess changes/evidence third. "
"Readers complete definite tasks without traversing implementation history "
"first."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:20
msgid "应用使用当前静态实例、typed factory 和 C 多态接口。"
msgstr ""
"Applications use current static instances, typed factories and C polymorphic"
" interfaces."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:21
msgid "默认配置是一份 authored TOML，SoC/Board 事实使用维护的 JSON。"
msgstr ""
"One authored TOML is the default configuration; maintained JSON supplies "
"SoC/Board facts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:22
msgid "接入说明保留上下文、deadline、借用、排空和失败恢复条件。"
msgstr ""
"Integration guidance retains context, deadlines, borrowing, draining and "
"recovery."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:23
msgid "生产支持、软件测试、ARM 链接、候选和 HIL 状态分别表达。"
msgstr ""
"Production support, software tests, ARM links, candidates and HIL are "
"separate."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:24
msgid "文档、源码、配置和已验证基线都有明确身份。"
msgstr ""
"Documents, source, configuration and qualified baselines have explicit "
"identities."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:25
msgid "一处维护规范内容，其他页面引用、包含或派生，不复制一套合同。"
msgstr ""
"Maintain authoritative contracts once; other pages link/include/derive them."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:26
msgid "内部链接、搜索和离线包覆盖当前正文；历史资料具有可见边界。"
msgstr ""
"Links/search/offline packages cover current prose; history has visible "
"boundaries."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:28
msgid ""
"文档系统不创建产品应用、任务、私有 PCB、Flash 分区、安全升级或恢复策略。 教程引用 X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples "
"的固定版本；平台仓库只保留通用测试夹具和 验证所需代码。文档发布不把软件模型或链接结果升级为实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"Docs create no product apps/tasks/private PCBs/Flash partitions/secure-"
"update/recovery policy. Tutorials pin X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples; platform "
"source keeps only common fixtures/validation code. Publication does not "
"promote models/linking into hardware qualification."

