#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "不依赖旧 API 的新消费工程"
msgstr "A new consumer independent of old APIs."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:42
msgid ""
"教程只走一条经过验证的路径；操作指南解决一个目标；参考给出精确规则；解释 说明原理与取舍。首页侧栏保持两层，复杂域通过索引页展开。搜索默认排除历史 "
"教程和大型原始证据，搜索结果显示当前版本、页面类别、实际正文语言和翻译状态。 正文摘要优先描述读者任务和技术内容；源码身份与资格边界单独显示，避免重复 "
"免责声明占据搜索摘要。首次操作统一引用 [固定源码与递归依赖指南](../guides/source-checkout.md)，不默认 GitHub "
"分支与 所读文档版本一致。"
msgstr ""
"Tutorials follow one verified path; how-to guides solve one goal; references"
" give exact rules; explanations describe principles/tradeoffs. Keep home "
"sidebars two levels deep, using domain indexes for complexity. Search "
"excludes historical tutorials/large raw evidence by default and labels "
"version, page category, actual prose language and translation state. "
"Summaries prioritize tasks/technical content, with source/qualification "
"shown separately so repeated disclaimers do not dominate. First operations "
"reference [pinned source/recursive dependencies](../guides/source-"
"checkout.md); never assume GitHub branches match the documentation version."

