#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:65
msgid ""
"芯片具备外设、provider 实现模式、Board 授权接线、软件执行和 HIL 通过，是不同 事实。派生表只读取已经定义的 "
"authority，不另建一套芯片能力或资格规则。 一个 CSV 的 implemented 不自动映射成 accepted；多个台账重叠，不能相加为 "
"项目完成百分比。旧记录保留原编号、原退出条件和失败尝试。"
msgstr ""
"Chip capability, implemented modes, authorized Board wiring, software "
"execution and HIL passes are distinct facts. Derived tables consume existing"
" authorities without new capability/qualification rules. CSV implemented "
"does not automatically become accepted. Overlapping ledgers cannot sum into "
"completion percentages. Preserve original IDs, exit conditions and failed "
"attempts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:70
msgid "4. 目标目录与渐进接入"
msgstr "4. Target directories and gradual integration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:93
msgid ""
"第一步把 Sphinx source root 改为 docs/，配置迁移期仍放 docs/sphinx/conf.py。 MyST 使现有 "
"design/delivery Markdown 成为真实文档页面，并进入导航和搜索。 "
"先接入正文和修复入口，再按映射移动可变内容；不先大批移动再修引用。"
msgstr ""
"First change the source root to docs/, retaining docs/sphinx/conf.py during "
"migration. MyST makes design/delivery Markdown navigable/searchable pages. "
"Integrate prose/fix entries before moving mutable content by mapping; do not"
" move everything before repairing references."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:97
msgid ""
"toctree 是唯一导航编排，README 是仓库入口。第一阶段可直接导航旧路径，后续 保持稳定 page ID 并维护小型 URL redirect"
" 表。相对链接按源文件实际位置解析， 移动时检查所有引用和显式 anchor。目录重组与规范意义变化分别评审。"
msgstr ""
"toctree is the sole navigation composition; READMEs are repository entry "
"points. Initially navigate existing paths, then retain stable page IDs with "
"a small redirect table. Resolve links by actual source location and check "
"every reference/explicit anchor on moves. Review reorganization separately "
"from normative changes."

