msgid "单正文源 + Sphinx gettext/PO，一条翻译链"
msgstr "One canonical source plus Sphinx gettext/PO; one translation chain."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "导航"
msgstr "Navigation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "toctree 和模块索引，不建立独立内容数据库"
msgstr "toctree/module indexes; no independent content database."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "状态"
msgstr "Status"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "复用能力派生、结果索引、CSV 和 identity 工具"
msgstr "Reuse capability derivation, result indexes, CSV and identity tools."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "主题"
msgstr "Theme"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "先沿用现有主题；内容/搜索合格后再独立评估"
msgstr ""
"Retain current theme first; evaluate separately after content/search "
"acceptance."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "图示"
msgstr "Diagrams"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "可编辑DOT + 本地SVG，Graphviz受锁；可用Sphinx内置graphviz扩展"
msgstr ""
"Editable DOT + local SVG with locked Graphviz; Sphinx graphviz may be used."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "交付"
msgstr "Delivery"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "相对链接的 HTML 包和 manifest，不依赖 CDN"
msgstr "Relative-link HTML packages/manifests without CDNs."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:125
msgid ""
"本轮不切换 MkDocs 或 Docusaurus，不引入额外前端运行时来完成基础导航。 已有 MyST/Sphinx "
"功能不足时，再以实际失败样例评估扩展。不要为每篇文档维护 第二份目录表、能力表或通用 snippet DSL。"
msgstr ""
"No switch to MkDocs/Docusaurus or extra frontend runtime for basic "
"navigation. Evaluate extensions against real failing examples when "
"MyST/Sphinx is insufficient. Do not maintain a second contents/capabilities "
"table or universal snippet DSL per document."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:129
msgid ""
"站点排除 docs/archive、Doxygen 生成输出、_build、原始日志、大型归档和软件 fixture "
"产物。状态页提供可读摘要和下载索引，原始证据不批量成为搜索页面。 源码相邻 README 不复制为第二份合同；若包含，须验证原相对链接的重定位。 "
"其他源码链接使用当前站点绑定的 Git revision，避免固定开发分支漂移。"
msgstr ""
"Exclude archives, generated Doxygen, _build, raw logs, large archives and "
"fixture outputs. Status pages provide readable summaries/download indexes "
"rather than indexing all evidence. Source-adjacent READMEs are not copied "
"contracts; inclusion verifies relocated links. Other source links bind the "
"site Git revision, avoiding moving development branches."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:134
msgid "6. 页面和 API 组织"
msgstr "6. Page and API organization"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:136
msgid "新公共页使用标准 MyST front matter，保持少量维护字段："
msgstr ""
"New public pages use standard MyST front matter with a few maintained "
"fields:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:145
msgid ""
"id 用于页面身份与迁移检查，不会自动生成 MyST 可引用 anchor。公共 anchor 使用 标准 MyST 显式 target 或 "
"Sphinx label，路径调整后保留并实际构建验证；旧 URL 由 redirect 处理，不另建引用框架。版本、更新时间、源码链接和验证状态从实际"
" Git/执行输入派生，不要求作者手填多个时间戳或复制源码 hash。 旧页在迁移时逐批补字段，不通过默认值伪造其语言或验证状态。"
msgstr ""
"id identifies pages/migration but does not automatically create MyST "
"anchors. Public anchors use explicit targets/Sphinx labels retained and "
"actually built after path changes; redirects handle old URLs without another"
" reference framework. Derive versions, updates, source links and validation "
"from Git/execution inputs rather than handwritten timestamps/copied hashes. "
"Add legacy metadata in batches without defaults fabricating language or "
"qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "页面类型"
msgstr "Page type"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "必需内容"
msgstr "Required content"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "tutorial"
msgstr "tutorial"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "目标、精确前提、固定配置、完整步骤、预期结果和清理"
msgstr ""
"Goals, exact prerequisites, pinned configuration, complete steps, "
"expectations and cleanup."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "how-to"
msgstr "how-to"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "单一任务、上下文、最短步骤、失败处理和适用边界"
msgstr "One task, contexts, minimum steps, failure handling and scope."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "reference"
msgstr "reference"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "字段/符号、范围、单位、拒绝条件与权威来源"
msgstr "Fields/symbols, ranges, units, rejections and authority."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "explanation"
msgstr "explanation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "问题、机制、取舍、边界，链接规范合同"
msgstr ""
"Problems, mechanisms, tradeoffs/boundaries and linked normative contracts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "status"
msgstr "status"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "source/config/scope、实际执行状态与证据定位"
msgstr "source/config/scope, actual execution and evidence locations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:159
msgid ""
"API 从一个总 doxygenindex 改为 Core、Arch、I/O、OS、Components 模块入口。 "
"每个设备页先连接公共合同与调用顺序，再进入自动生成符号。不要手抄函数声明。"
msgstr ""
"Replace one aggregate doxygenindex with Core/Arch/I/O/OS/Components entries."
" Device pages link contracts/call order before generated symbols. Do not "
"hand-copy declarations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:162
msgid ""
"factory 单独解释：查找返回已生成静态对象，日常 I/O 直接通过 face 调用 provider。 示例使用实际生成的 "
"nexus_factory.h；默认 ID、strong-ID 和可选能力记录各有 精确配置和执行证据。公开头文件与每次装配生成的接口不能混为全平台恒定"
" API。"
msgstr ""
"Explain factories separately: lookups return generated static objects; "
"ordinary I/O calls providers directly through faces. Examples use actual "
"nexus_factory.h. Default IDs, strong IDs and optional capabilities each bind"
" exact configuration/execution. Public headers and assembly-generated "
"interfaces are not one platform-wide invariant API."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:166
msgid "7. 双语与图示"
msgstr "7. Bilingual content and diagrams"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:168
msgid ""
"![目标文档系统的内容、API、状态、图示与交付链路](../assets/diagrams/documentation-target.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Target documentation content, API, status, diagrams and delivery "
"chain](../assets/diagrams/documentation-target.svg)"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:168
msgid "目标文档系统的内容、API、状态、图示与交付链路"
msgstr ""
"Target documentation content, API, status, diagrams and delivery chain."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:170
msgid ""
"图为目标设计，不代表已实现。箭头表示输入/产物传递；软件和HIL只读记录，文档 构建不产生平台资格。来源与完整说明见 "
"[FIG-12](../assets/diagrams/README.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This is target design, not implementation evidence. Arrows carry "
"inputs/artifacts; software/HIL records are read-only and documentation "
"builds establish no platform qualification. See "
"[FIG-12](../assets/diagrams/README.md) for sources/details."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:173
msgid ""
"每篇正文只有一份 canonical source，记录原始语言。所有当前页面提供完整中文和 英文正文；中文原文也通过同一 gettext "
"链生成英文。混合语言合同可使用原文语言 的已审查 catalog，翻译其中另一语言的说明，不复制另一份规范源。 API "
"标识符、配置键、错误码、CSV、JSON 和原始日志保持原字节或语义。"
msgstr ""
"Each page has one canonical source declaring its original language. Every "
"current page provides complete English and Chinese prose; Chinese originals "
"generate English through the same gettext chain. Mixed contracts may use "
"reviewed source-language catalogs to translate their other-language passages"
" without duplicating canonical contracts. API identifiers, keys, error "
"codes, CSV/JSON and raw logs retain original bytes or meaning."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:178
msgid ""
"gettext/PO 是唯一翻译链。翻译审查绑定原文版本；原文变化后，受影响翻译进入 stale 或 fuzzy，不能因 "
"language=zh_CN/en 构建成功而记录翻译完成。 状态只有 "
"reviewed、stale、missing、original，按页派生并在页面可见。"
msgstr ""
"gettext/PO is the sole translation chain. Review binds source versions; "
"after source changes, affected translations become stale/fuzzy rather than "
"appearing complete because locale builds pass. Only "
"reviewed/stale/missing/original states exist, derived per page and visible."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:182
msgid ""
"翻译门禁分别用中文原文和英文原文验证 en/zh_CN round-trip、缺译 fallback、 "
"stale/fuzzy。标记依据实际正文语言和审查状态，不能被构建 locale 覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Use both Chinese/English originals to test en/zh_CN round-trips, missing "
"fallback and stale/fuzzy states. Actual prose language/review state "
"determines labels; build locales cannot override them."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:185
msgid ""
"所有当前页面的可见规范正文需完成独立语义审查且无未处理 fuzzy。快速检查核对 "
"原文摘要和审查标记，严格构建还核对新提取的完整消息集合；缺译或过期时失败。 开发预览仍准确显示实际语言和缺译状态。历史归档保留原翻译范围，不建立新资格。"
msgstr ""
"Visible normative prose on every current page requires independent semantic "
"review with no unresolved fuzzy entries. Fast checks validate source "
"digests/review markers; strict builds also require the fresh complete "
"message set. Missing/stale translations fail. Previews truthfully show "
"actual language/gaps. Archives retain original translation/qualification "
"scope."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:189
msgid ""
"图示保留可审查源，输出本地资源。首批不依赖在线 Mermaid/CDN、外部字体或脚本。 "
"新增渲染器需要独立工具锁和实际验证；图的箭头、生命周期和支持边界随正文评审。 离线包检查图像、搜索、导航与双语入口，不只检查首页存在。 "
"完整15类必需图及视觉、源码和失败路径约束由内容与图示标准定义。"
msgstr ""
"Keep reviewable diagram sources and local outputs without online "
"Mermaid/CDNs/external fonts/scripts. New renderers need locks/actual "
"validation; arrows, lifecycles and support scope are reviewed with prose. "
"Offline checks cover images/search/navigation/bilingual entries, not home "
"pages alone. Content/diagram standards define all fifteen classes and "
"visual/source/failure rules."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:194
msgid "8. 示例与文档门禁"
msgstr "8. Examples and documentation gates"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:196
msgid ""
"代码示例优先从真实 fixture 或固定 external example literalinclude，不维护一套 "
"无法编译的手抄实现。完整使用教程需实际消费当前 Source SDK；声明硬件命令时 注明工具、板卡和连接前提，普通文档构建不刷写或访问设备。 "
"external example 先取得固定 revision/hash 的本地输入并记录许可证，Sphinx 只读 "
"该输入，不在构建时联网取得最新版或执行外部仓库脚本。"
msgstr ""
"Prefer literalinclude from real fixtures or pinned external examples instead"
" of unbuildable handwritten copies. Complete tutorials actually consume "
"current source SDKs. Hardware commands state tools/Boards/connections; "
"normal builds never flash or access devices. Fetch/pin external "
"revision/hash/license inputs beforehand; Sphinx reads them without fetching "
"latest or running external scripts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:202
msgid ""
"完整 TOML 使用生产 resolver。Board/CPU JSON 通过实际接入路径验证，不能只 做 JSON syntax "
"check。部分示例有明确 fragment 原因，保留语法检查，但不计为 完整可执行配置。现有 nexus-toml-fragment 约定继续使用。"
msgstr ""
"Full TOML uses production resolvers. Board/CPU JSON follows actual "
"integration paths, not syntax-only checks. Explained fragments retain syntax"
" checks without complete-configuration qualification. Keep nexus-toml-"
"fragment conventions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:206
msgid ""
"维护的 shell/CMake 流程只由明确审核的 fixture 执行，不能从任意 Markdown 自动 "
"提取并执行命令。完整片段、示意片段和执行报告的范围分别呈现。"
msgstr ""
"Only explicitly reviewed fixtures execute maintained shell/CMake flows; "
"never extract/run arbitrary Markdown commands. Complete fragments, "
"illustrations and execution reports state separate scopes."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "层级"
msgstr "Layer"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
