msgstr "commit/CI"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "配置示例"
msgstr "Configuration examples"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "完整 TOML 与 JSON 的实际 resolver、片段原因"
msgstr "Actual complete TOML/JSON resolvers and fragment rationale."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
