msgstr "Public API"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "既有注释合同 + Doxygen/Breathe 严格构建"
msgstr "Existing comment contracts + strict Doxygen/Breathe."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "API/文档 CI"
msgstr "API/docs CI."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "全站"
msgstr "Whole site"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "MyST/Sphinx 严格引用、导航、搜索、翻译状态、资源"
msgstr ""
"Strict MyST/Sphinx references, navigation, search, translation status and "
"resources."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "CI/发布"
msgstr "CI/publication."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "外部链接"
msgstr "External links"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "有限 timeout/retry，分开报告404与网络不可达"
msgstr "Bounded timeout/retry; distinguish 404 from network failure."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "定期/发布"
msgstr "Periodic/publication."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "发布后"
msgstr "Post-publication"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "实际站点身份、关键页、旧URL、资源与下载"
msgstr ""
"Actual site identity, critical pages, legacy URLs, resources/downloads."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:0
msgid "实际部署后"
msgstr "After actual deployment."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:219
msgid ""
"commit 快速检查默认离线，不每次重跑固件全平台资格。新增文档工具与 gate 使用 Python unittest 的实际 "
"RED→GREEN；新增 C 行为测试用 GoogleTest/GoogleMock， "
"示例消费用现有真实构建。纯正文调整运行相应文档检查，不增加镜像实现的测试。"
msgstr ""
"Commit checks default offline without rerunning complete firmware "
"qualification. New doc tools/gates use actual Python unittest RED→GREEN; C "
"behavior tests use GoogleTest/GoogleMock and examples use existing real "
"builds. Prose changes run applicable checks, without implementation-"
"mirroring tests."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:223
msgid "9. 一个工具入口"
msgstr "9. One tool entry"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:225
msgid "统一工具入口如下，安装工具与实际验收见文档维护指南："
msgstr ""
"Unified entry below; tool installation/acceptance is in the maintenance "
"guide:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:237
msgid ""
"dev.py 保持薄路由，文档模块复用现有 process runner、超时、退出码和 identity。 docs.py/.sh/.ps1/.bat"
" 转为转发或明确迁移提示，不各自维护生成规则。"
msgstr ""
"dev.py stays a thin route; docs reuse process runners, timeouts, exits and "
"identity. docs.py/.sh/.ps1/.bat forward or state migration rather than "
"maintaining separate generation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:240
msgid "check 验证受维护的源文档和实际配置片段，不建立平台资格。"
msgstr ""
"check validates maintained sources/configuration examples without platform "
"qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:241
msgid "build 在新输出根执行 Doxygen 与 Sphinx；统一 -n -W --keep-going。"
msgstr "build runs Doxygen/Sphinx in fresh outputs with -n -W --keep-going."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:242
msgid "preview 服务已成功生成的目录，不隐式安装或替换依赖。"
msgstr ""
"preview serves successful outputs without implicit installation/dependency "
"replacement."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:243
msgid "package 验证成功输出和身份后封存，不自动发布平台或产品。"
msgstr ""
"package verifies success/identity and seals outputs, without publishing "
"products/platforms automatically."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:244
msgid "doctor 区分缺工具、版本不符和未执行资格。"
msgstr ""
"doctor distinguishes absent tools, wrong versions and unexecuted "
"qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:246
msgid ""
"真实失败码、详细诊断和原始日志必须保留。输出目录受 ownership 控制，不能覆盖 输入；旧 XML/HTML "
"不能作为新构建成功的输入。重复构建隔离输出和翻译缓存。 Breathe XML 路径由本次输出根注入，不能继续固定读取 docs/api 的旧结果。"
msgstr ""
"Preserve actual exits, diagnostics and logs. Ownership-controlled outputs "
"cannot overwrite inputs. Old XML/HTML never substitutes for fresh success. "
"Isolate repeated outputs/translation caches. Inject this build’s Breathe XML"
" path rather than reading old docs/api results."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:250
msgid ""
"文档 Python 传递依赖和 wheel hash 形成独立闭包；首次支持 Linux x86_64 的已 执行 Python "
"tuple。Doxygen 输入也固定版本及字节身份；Doxygen的HAVE_DOT=NO "
"不表示文档图链不使用Graphviz。图渲染的Graphviz和实际字体一并进入闭包。 干净环境实际执行 require-hashes 安装，不用 "
"lock 的存在 替代安装结果。其他主机资格独立记录。"
msgstr ""
"Python dependencies/wheel hashes form a separate closure, initially the "
"executed Linux x86_64 Python tuple. Doxygen version/bytes are pinned. "
"HAVE_DOT=NO does not mean the docs chain lacks Graphviz; pin rendering "
"Graphviz/actual fonts too. Execute require-hashes installation in clean "
"environments; lock files alone prove no installation. Other hosts qualify "
"separately."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:256
msgid "10. 版本和发布身份"
msgstr "10. Version/publication identity"

