"完整格式以[唯一交付合同](../reference/documentation-delivery.md)和生产打包器为准："
msgstr ""
"Documentation manifests reuse existing identity and evidence-location "
"structures. The table maps actual schema-1 fields only; the [single delivery"
" contract](../reference/documentation-delivery.md) and production packager "
"define the complete format:"

