msgstr ""
"Successful payload `path`, `bytes` and `sha256`; exclude "
"manifest/checksums/archive/outer receipts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:271
msgid ""
"三种源码身份不能互相覆盖。文档更新可引用经过验证的旧代码记录，不把该记录 重新标记为当前 HEAD "
"已执行。若描述的代码与资格不同，页面显示各自来源和边界。 本方案描述的起点是 docs HEAD 7abde0e4、qualified code "
"cc6a065c；历史 SoC 记录保持独立。计划工具一旦实现变更，按新源码执行其门禁。"
msgstr ""
"The three source identities never overwrite one another. Docs may cite "
"verified older code without labeling its execution as current HEAD. Display "
"described/qualified sources separately where different. This plan began at "
"docs HEAD 7abde0e4 and qualified code cc6a065c; historical SoC records "
"remain independent. New implemented tools execute gates on their new source."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:276
msgid "版本 URL 结构如下；具体已发布版本以实际发布记录为准："
msgstr ""
"Version URLs follow this structure; actual publication records determine "
"published versions:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:285
msgid ""
"release-id 唯一绑定文档 manifest；相同 platform_version 的文档修订也不能覆盖 已发布不可变目录。stable "
"只是已验收软件 SDK 文档入口，不代表全部 HIL 已通过。 HIL 未执行允许按真实状态发布软件文档，不能发布虚构的实板支持。"
msgstr ""
"release-id binds one manifest; doc updates with unchanged platform versions "
"still cannot overwrite immutable directories. stable is an accepted "
"software-SDK docs entry, not all-HIL-passed. Truthful unexecuted HIL permits"
" software docs publication without invented physical support."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:289
msgid ""
"PR 首阶段通过有身份的 CI artifact 预览。发布使用受信任部署作业和已验证输出， 不在高权限上下文执行外部 PR 源码。版本站点和 "
"stable 指针只有实际部署后才能 记为 published；工作流存在或 build 成功都不是公开发布证据。 "
"发布前的外链报告绑定本次输入，分别记录坏链与网络不可达；必需源码、规范和 下载入口未验证时不能报告交付通过，非必需引用的限制明确保留。"
msgstr ""
"Initially preview PRs as identified CI artifacts. Trusted deployment "
"consumes verified output without elevated execution of external PR source. "
"Sites/stable become published only after actual deployment; workflows/build "
"success are not public proof. External-link reports bind current inputs and "
"distinguish bad links/network limits. Unverified essential "
"source/standards/download entries prevent delivery passes; optional-"
"reference limitations remain explicit."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:295
msgid ""
"旧 /en、/zh_CN、/api 入口逐项处理。旧 HAL/OSAL/Kconfig 页转向标明版本的 "
"历史或迁移页，不能把同名旧函数静默重定向为不同合同的新接口。"
msgstr ""
"Handle legacy /en, /zh_CN and /api individually. Old HAL/OSAL/Kconfig pages "
"point to versioned history/migration rather than silently redirecting same-"
"named functions to different contracts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:298
msgid "11. 离线包、下载和恢复"
msgstr "11. Offline packages, downloads and restoration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:312
msgid ""
"HTML、图、搜索和内部链接全部相对化，不依赖 CDN。公开定位不要求原 workspace 路径；历史 receipts "
"的绝对路径保留原样，新增归档/member导航提供取得步骤。 大型原始档案单独发布，不默认装入整个网站；缺少可下载对象时明确记录 local-only。"
msgstr ""
"Relative HTML/images/search/links need no CDN. Public locations do not "
"depend on original workspace paths; retain receipt paths and provide "
"archive/member retrieval instructions. Publish large evidence separately "
"rather than copying it into sites; unavailable downloads are explicitly "
"local-only."

msgid ""
"manifest 绑定输入与payload；checksums 覆盖payload和manifest，不包含自身。 外层 archive hash "
"放在独立 receipt，不形成包内自引用。使用既有归档/校验工具， 不建立第二个平台候选状态机。HTML 包只证明文档交付，不替代 "
"SDK/MCU/HIL。 HTML 可以显示输入身份，不能嵌入覆盖自身的最终 manifest hash；manifest 与 checksums "
"都不进入 `manifest.files`，避免间接形成自引用。"
msgstr ""
"Manifests bind inputs/payload; checksums cover payload/manifests but not "
"themselves. Outer archive hashes belong in separate receipts, avoiding self-"
"reference. Reuse archive/verifier tools without another candidate state "
"machine. HTML proves docs delivery, not SDK/MCU/HIL. Pages may display "
"source identity but never their self-covering final manifest hash; "
"manifests/checksums are excluded from `manifest.files` to avoid indirect "
"cycles."


#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:322
msgid ""
"CI artifact 用于预览，长期发布必须有稳定位置、保留策略和校验。实际从独立根 "
"取得并恢复，浏览关键页并验真；异地故障域恢复依赖真实存储，未执行不标完成。 时间/路径造成的可消除差异可以规范化，但字节复现结论必须由实际双构建建立。"
msgstr ""
"CI artifacts serve previews; long-term publications need stable "
"locations/retention/verification. Actually retrieve/restore in independent "
"roots, browse key pages and verify. Cross-failure-domain recovery depends on"
" real storage; unexecuted work stays incomplete. Normalize removable "
"path/time differences, but actual dual builds establish reproducibility."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:326
msgid "12. 实施工作包与排程"
msgstr "12. Work packages and scheduling"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:328
msgid ""
"D1至D6是工作包分类，不表示必须依次完成的六个时间阶段。实际执行顺序以 "
"台账的dependencies有向无环图为准；预估工期须在工具和内容范围确认后另行记录。 "
"术语基线DOC-21与图工具/离线规则DOC-25先于依赖它们的正文和图示交付。 "
"DOC-58逐图审查可以并行推进，但最终关闭必须等待全部15类图及相关检查完成。"
msgstr ""
"D1–D6 are categories, not six mandatory sequential periods. Follow ledger "
"dependency DAGs; estimate dates after tooling/content scope is known. DOC-21"
" terminology and DOC-25 diagram/offline rules precede dependent content. "
"DOC-58 review can run in parallel, but closure waits for all fifteen "
"classes/checks."

