msgstr ""
"Versions/offline packages, actual publication checks and independent "
"restoration."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:342
msgid ""
"基础规则先确认，工具与正文并行，发布依赖成功构建、身份、关键内容、翻译 状态及完整图册审查；平台 main/版本集成是实际发布的外部依赖，不能从本方案 "
"推断已合入或部署。所有维护责任由 Codex 承担，必要独立评审由其他 agent 执行。"
msgstr ""
"Establish base rules first; tools/prose run in parallel. Publication depends"
" on successful builds, identities, critical content, translations and "
"complete diagram review. Platform main/version integration is external; this"
" plan cannot imply merge/deployment. Codex owns maintenance; other agents "
"perform required independent reviews."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:346
msgid ""
"每个 DOC 编号分别记录 implementation_status、validation_status 和 exit_condition。 "
"原专项台账不重新编号。本文档系统台账与既有48项构建台账、对话中的48项全项目 优化建议不同；全项目建议需另建独立台账，不混入文档完成度。"
msgstr ""
"Each DOC ID records implementation_status, validation_status and "
"exit_condition separately. Do not renumber original ledgers. This "
"documentation ledger differs from the existing 48-item build ledger and "
"conversational 48-item whole-project proposal; that proposal needs its own "
"ledger rather than documentation-completion aggregation."

