#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:357
msgid "全部当前页面中英文正文实际审查通过；预览的原文/stale/missing 状态保持真实。"
msgstr ""
"Actual English/Chinese review of every current page, with truthful "
"original/stale/missing previews."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:358
msgid "本地/CI使用相同严格规则，故意错误、缺工具、失效输入真实失败并保留诊断。"
msgstr ""
"Identical strict local/CI rules with real bad-input/missing-tool failures "
"and diagnostics."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:359
