#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:360
msgid "文档、代码、资格与工具身份可读可验证；历史执行和HIL状态保持真实。"
msgstr ""
"Readable/verifiable docs/code/qualification/tool identity and truthful "
"history/HIL."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:361
msgid "干净环境生成的离线包可独立浏览验真，下载与实际站点身份匹配。"
msgstr ""
"Clean-environment offline packages browse/verify independently; downloads "
"match actual sites."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:362
msgid "发布和恢复有实际结果；未建立的主机、存储或硬件资格继续保留条件。"
msgstr ""
