#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-system.md:363
msgid ""
"全部15类必需图及两张补充图完成图文、视觉及离线审查；历史规划中的四个 图的身份与验证范围分别记录，未声明支持的配置和后续扩展仍明确标注边界。"
msgstr ""
"Semantic/visual/offline review of fifteen required plus two supplemental "
"diagrams. Record identity/scope of four historical planned diagrams "
"separately; unclaimed configurations/extensions retain explicit boundaries."

